+## Lemma: Grid-to-continuum minimax comparison
+Status: proved
+Assumptions: Finite law class \(\Theta\); public exogenous prices; randomized policies; continuum quote set \([0,1]\); grid \(G_K=\{0,1/K,\ldots,(K-1)/K\}\). Let \(\mathcal R_{[0,1]}\) and \(\mathcal R_{G_K}\) be the signed minimax regret values with matching learner/comparator action sets.
